{# cyrillic-ext (25 ÃÅ¡Ãâ€˜) ÃÂ¸ latin-ext (72 ÃÅ¡Ãâ€˜) ÃÂÃâ€¢ ÃÂ¿Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ´ÃÂ·ÃÂ°ÃÂ³Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ¶ÃÂ°ÃÂµÃÂ¼: ÃÂ² ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ¶ÃÂ°Ã‘â€š
   ÃÂ³ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€žÃ‘â€¹, ÃÂºÃÂ¾Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ½ÃÂµÃ‘â€š ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ ÃÂ½ÃÂ° ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¹ Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€ ÃÂµ UI (Ã¢ÂÂ´, Ã¢â€šÂ´, ÃÂ´ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¿. ÃÂºÃÂ¸Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ»ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€ ÃÂ°),
   ÃÂ° preload Ã‘â€šÃ‘ÂÃÂ½Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ» ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ±ÃÂµÃÂ·Ã‘Æ’Ã‘ÂÃÂ»ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾. unicode-range + font-display: swap ÃÂ² cascade.css
   ÃÂ·ÃÂ°ÃÂ³Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ·Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€š Ã‘ÂÃÂ°ÃÂ±Ã‘ÂÃÂµÃ‘â€š ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾, ÃÂµÃ‘ÂÃÂ»ÃÂ¸ Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ´ÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ³ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€ž ÃÂ²Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€˜-Ã‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂºÃÂ¸ ÃÂ²Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃ‘â€šÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃ‘ÂÃ‘Â. #}
<style>
/* Critical: background and gradient before cascade.css to prevent FOUC */
html {
	height: 100%;
	background-color: #0f1419;
}
:root[data-theme="light"] {
	background-color: #ffffff;
}
body {
	min-height: 100%;
	margin: 0;
	background-color: inherit;
	background-image:
		radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(var(--proton-accent-rgb, 94, 158, 255), 0.06) 0%, transparent 50%),
		radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(var(--proton-accent-rgb, 94, 158, 255), 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),
		linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1419 0%, #1a1f2e 100%);
	background-attachment: fixed;
}
:root[data-theme="light"] body {
	background-image:
		radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(var(--proton-accent-rgb, 75, 85, 99), 0.04) 0%, transparent 50%),
		radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(var(--proton-accent-rgb, 75, 85, 99), 0.025) 0%, transparent 50%),
		linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8f9fa 100%);
}

/* Critical: keep header height stable before cascade.css loads */
:root {
	--proton-page-max-width: 1200px;
	--proton-page-gutter: 20px;
}

#menubar {
	min-height: 64px;
	padding: 0;
}

#menubar-inner {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 16px;
	height: 64px;
	max-width: var(--proton-page-max-width);
	margin: 0 auto;
	padding: 0 var(--proton-page-gutter);
}

/* Critical: prevent "Loading viewÃ¢â‚¬Â¦" flash/jump before cascade.css is loaded */
#maincontent > .spinning,
#maincontent > p.spinning,
#view > .spinning,
#view > p.spinning {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	gap: 12px;
	width: 100%;
	min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
	padding: 24px !important;
	text-align: center;
	padding-left: 0 !important;
}

#maincontent > .spinning::before,
#maincontent > p.spinning::before,
#view > .spinning::before,
#view > p.spinning::before {
	position: static;
	left: auto;
	top: auto;
	margin-top: 0;
}

/* Critical: server-rendered managed alerts must not flash inline before cascade.css */
.alert-message.proton-alert-floating[data-proton-managed="true"] {
	position: fixed;
	top: 84px;
	right: 24px;
	z-index: 2200;
	width: min(420px, calc(100vw - 48px));
	margin-bottom: 0;
	opacity: 0;
	transform: translateY(-10px);
	pointer-events: none;
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
	.alert-message.proton-alert-floating[data-proton-managed="true"] {
		top: 72px;
		right: 12px;
		width: calc(100vw - 24px);
	}
}
</style>
{# ÃÅ¡ÃÂ»Ã‘Å½Ã‘â€¡ ÃÂºÃ‘ÂÃ‘Ë†ÃÂ° Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂ¸ÃÂºÃÂ¸ = ÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘ÂÃÂ¸Ã‘Â Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ¼Ã‘â€¹ + pkgs_update_time (ÃÂ²Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¼Ã‘Â ÃÂ¸ÃÂ·ÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸Ã‘Â ÃÂ±ÃÂ°ÃÂ·Ã‘â€¹
